=== Test: Flex align-content:stretch 多行填充 ===
Frame #1 events=0 detail=normal
div (0,0 300x200) [dsp=flex]
  div (0,0 140x50) text="Item1"
  div (140,0 140x50) text="Item2"
  div (0,100 140x50) text="Item3"

