=== Test: Flex align-content:center 多行居中 ===
Frame #1 events=0 detail=normal
div (0,0 300x200) [dsp=flex]
  div (0,50 140x50) text="C1"
  div (140,50 140x50) text="C2"
  div (0,100 140x50) text="C3"

