=== Test: Flex-basis:content 两行不等宽 ===
Frame #1 events=0 detail=normal
div (0,0 400x40) [dsp=flex]
  div (0,0 80x40) fg=0 text="HelloWorld"
  div (80,0 40x40) fg=0 text="Short"

